    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A virtual filesystem that is the root of the filesystem tree of the <ref refid="namespace_player" kindref="compound">Player</ref>. Contrary to other filesystems the root-fs does navigate into other VFS. Non-prefixed path access forwards to the <ref refid="class_native_filesystem" kindref="compound">NativeFilesystem</ref>. When namespaced (ns://) it is forwarded to the appropriate filesystem that supports this namespace. This ensures that code such as<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Exists(&quot;/home/user/some_file.txt&quot;)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exists(&quot;apk://assets/some_file.txt&quot;) works as expected. Non-prefixed path access forwards to the <ref refid="class_native_filesystem" kindref="compound">NativeFilesystem</ref>. Paths with namespaces (ns://) are forwarded to the appropriate filesystem that supports this namespace. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
